# Architecture

The engine has three layers.[^layers] See the
[getting started guide](getting-started.crv) for the basics.

Cooling uses H{,2,}O and this is the 10{^th^} revision.

The reference implementation is documented well.[^layers]

[^layers]: Parser, scheduler, and renderer.
